      <strong>In plain English:</strong> You can browse this site without creating an account or giving us any personal details. We use Google Analytics to understand traffic and Google AdSense to show ads, and those services use cookies. You can opt out of personalized ads at any time (see Section 6), and you can ask us to access or delete anything you send us through the contact form.
